      "value": "Could it be that your issue is related to this bug? https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/inputfield-with-contenttype-password-now-sets-as-real-value\n\nIf so, you can work around it by setting the InputField type to \"regular\" instead of \"password\".",
