  "details": "Password for Input field keyboard doesn't work as it should be.\nExpected :\n 1. On selecting the InputField, keyboard shown up as password keyboard.\n 2.Input field is able to show password on unmask operation (Perhaps, the eye thingies on the left).\n 3.After submitted InputField.text have unmasked string.\nActual: \n1. ✓ On selecting the InputField, keyboard shown up as password keyboard.\n 2. ✘ Input field CANNOT show password on unmask operation.\n 3. ✘ After submitted InputField.text it's doesn't have correct value.\n- Modify outside built in keyboard still function normally.\n- In the example below, using non number on keyboard bypass \"Number only\" InputField. (It's still ignored on submit.)\n----------------\nI've just found this after one of my world that have password type InputField doesn't work anymore. I don't actually know when but it still persists ion build 1248.\n----------------\nVideo: https://streamable.com/at3ane\n(This is example from https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_0cccf522-dac9-4f40-96df-1413576debf9 ) which test only submitting the password.",
